R75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"vhw5DnAvZZHqDjrEHKoNbQ","review_id":"OTRE9uLLdtJ129J_qhvVKw","date":"2020-11-24T04:05:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9367503523826599,"text_excerpt":"If you like hookah and want a low key relaxing night out then this is my suggested place to go to. Came here on a Wednesday night & the drinks were good, the music being played was good. They have games available for customers to play such as connect 4, jenga, UNO cards. It's a dope place for a low key night. The food looked really good, I personally didn't order anything but my party of 6 did order some appetizers and they said it was very good. The hookah has a variety of flavors and every so often the staff changed the coal."},{"business_id":"vhw5DnAvZZHqDjrEHKoNbQ","review_id":"X895qz8jXSx4ms8h8mS_PA","date":"2021-03-11T03:20:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9352490305900574,"text_excerpt":"Heard lots of buzz about this place so I decided to give it a try. Cool place to socialize with friends while you PSSITA! Food and drink service was fast, QR code for menu. We ordered the chicken wings, nothing to brag about. The drinks were kinda pricey. Ultimately, I'd say go for the hookah, and social environment. Ask for the Scooby Doo flavor!"},{"business_id":"vhw5DnAvZZHqDjrEHKoNbQ","review_id":"25HWVwN3tQmQ_p6eYW6azQ","date":"2021-01-14T06:46:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9276190996170044,"text_excerpt":"I love this place! Super chill! Very modern with beautiful decor. Parking wasn't a problem for me but I could see how it could be for others when it's packed. But y'all know how street parking in New Orleans can be. The owner is as nice as can be! Just for his hospitality alone, I'll be back! He answered all of our questions and gave us a few laughs. Me and my girls bought a bottle and got a section upstairs. The service was great. Speedy and friendly! The music was good as well. The ambiance was great. The food is really good (try the wings) and so were the drinks. The hookah special was $10 for basic flavors and you can mix flavors if you want. Definitely a good place to hangout and cat..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"vhw5DnAvZZHqDjrEHKoNbQ","photo_id":"ZZF30AIVGYEJ2cIJfX1G7g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ZZF30AIVGYEJ2cIJfX1G7g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8510065078735352},{"business_id":"vhw5DnAvZZHqDjrEHKoNbQ","photo_id":"YwostDluKA1fVpJgj5tGZg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/YwostDluKA1fVpJgj5tGZg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8365073800086975},{"business_id":"vhw5DnAvZZHqDjrEHKoNbQ","photo_id":"FLIgdLMoprRymzA0GtynkA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/FLIgdLMoprRymzA0GtynkA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7784271240234375},{"business_id":"vhw5DnAvZZHqDjrEHKoNbQ","photo_id":"Ly1xf6Ri-fvJ7VugwDrfwA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Ly1xf6Ri-fvJ7VugwDrfwA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7219086289405823}]},"notebook_case":null}
